<section class="ph"><div class="ph-media"><img class="ph-img" src="/assets/img/photos/meeting-table.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/meeting-table-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/meeting-table.webp 1200w" sizes="100vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"></div><div class="wrap ph-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><i aria-hidden="true">/</i><span aria-current="page">Services</span></nav><p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">What we do</p><h1>Insurance Appraisal Services in Michigan</h1><p class="ph-lede">From a single estimate second opinion to full panel representation and neutral umpire work, every Michigan Insurance Appraiser service is built around an accurate, defensible valuation of your loss.</p><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn-maize" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> Call (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn btn-glass" href="/request-claim-review/">Free claim review</a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="scards" data-stagger><a class="scard rv" href="/michigan-claim-appraisal/appraisal-demand-representation/"><span class="sc-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/meeting-table.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/meeting-table-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/meeting-table.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="sc-body"><span class="bc-ic"><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 11l3 3L22 4"/><path d="M21 12v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11"/></svg></span><h2>Appraisal Demand Representation</h2><p>We serve as your appraiser after an appraisal demand under Michigan’s statutory process for disputed loss amounts.</p><span class="more">Learn more <svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="scard rv" href="/michigan-claim-appraisal/homeowner-claim-appraiser/"><span class="sc-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/suburban-home.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/suburban-home-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/suburban-home.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="sc-body"><span class="bc-ic"><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 10.5L12 3l9 7.5V21a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-5v-7H9v7H4a1 1 0 0 1-1-1z"/></svg></span><h2>Homeowner Claim Appraisal</h2><p>Independent appraisal for Michigan homeowners whose insurer underpaid a roof, water, fire or storm claim.</p><span class="more">Learn more <svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="scard rv" href="/michigan-claim-appraisal/commercial-condo-hoa-appraisal/"><span class="sc-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/apartment-block.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/apartment-block-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/apartment-block.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="875" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="sc-body"><span class="bc-ic"><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="4" y="2" width="16" height="20" rx="2"/><path d="M9 6h2M13 6h2M9 10h2M13 10h2M9 14h2M13 14h2M10 22v-4h4v4"/></svg></span><h2>Commercial, Condo &amp; HOA Appraisal</h2><p>Appraisal for Michigan businesses, multifamily owners, condo associations and HOAs with disputed property losses.</p><span class="more">Learn more <svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="scard rv" href="/michigan-claim-appraisal/hail-roof-damage-appraisal/"><span class="sc-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/roof-shingles.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/roof-shingles-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/roof-shingles.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="795" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="sc-body"><span class="bc-ic"><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 16.6A5 5 0 0 0 18 7h-1.3A8 8 0 1 0 4 15.3"/><path d="M8 19v1M8 14v1M16 19v1M16 14v1M12 21v1M12 16v1"/></svg></span><h2>Hail &amp; Roof Damage Appraisal</h2><p>Appraisal for Michigan hail and roof claims, from bruised shingles and dented metal to repair-versus-replace disputes.</p><span class="more">Learn more <svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="scard rv" href="/michigan-claim-appraisal/windstorm-tornado-appraisal/"><span class="sc-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/tornado-damage.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/tornado-damage-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/tornado-damage.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="797" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="sc-body"><span class="bc-ic"><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M17.7 7.7A2.5 2.5 0 1 1 19.5 12H2M9.6 4.6A2 2 0 1 1 11 8H2M12.6 19.4A2 2 0 1 0 14 16H2"/></svg></span><h2>Windstorm &amp; Tornado Appraisal</h2><p>Appraisal for Michigan windstorm, derecho and tornado claims, from creased shingles to total losses.</p><span class="more">Learn more <svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="scard rv" href="/michigan-claim-appraisal/ice-dam-frozen-pipe-appraisal/"><span class="sc-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/icicles.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/icicles-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/icicles.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="815" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="sc-body"><span class="bc-ic"><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2v20M4.9 4.9l14.2 14.2M2 12h20M4.9 19.1L19.1 4.9M9 3l3 3 3-3M9 21l3-3 3 3M3 9l3 3-3 3M21 9l-3 3 3 3"/></svg></span><h2>Ice Dam &amp; Frozen Pipe Appraisal</h2><p>Appraisal for Michigan ice dam leaks and frozen pipe bursts when the insurer accepts the loss but underpays it.</p><span class="more">Learn more <svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="scard rv" href="/michigan-claim-appraisal/water-sewer-backup-appraisal/"><span class="sc-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/flooded-basement.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/flooded-basement-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/flooded-basement.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="798" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="sc-body"><span class="bc-ic"><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 22a7 7 0 0 0 7-7c0-2-1-3.9-3-5.5s-3.5-4-4-6.5c-.5 2.5-2 4.9-4 6.5S5 13 5 15a7 7 0 0 0 7 7z"/></svg></span><h2>Water &amp; Sewer Backup Appraisal</h2><p>Appraisal for Michigan basement water, plumbing and sewer backup claims when the scope or price is in dispute.</p><span class="more">Learn more <svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="scard rv" href="/michigan-claim-appraisal/fire-smoke-loss-appraisal/"><span class="sc-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/house-fire.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/house-fire-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/house-fire.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="sc-body"><span class="bc-ic"><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8.5 14.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 11 12c0-1.4-.5-2-1-3-1.1-2.1-.2-4 2-6 .5 2.5 2 4.9 4 6.5 2 1.6 3 3.5 3 5.5a7 7 0 1 1-14 0c0-1.2.4-2.3 1-3.4.4 1.4 1.4 2.4 2.5 2.4z"/></svg></span><h2>Fire &amp; Smoke Loss Appraisal</h2><p>Appraisal for Michigan fire and smoke claims, from soot cleanup disputes to full rebuild and code upgrade costs.</p><span class="more">Learn more <svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="scard rv" href="/michigan-claim-appraisal/fallen-tree-ice-storm-appraisal/"><span class="sc-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/ice-storm-tree.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/ice-storm-tree-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/ice-storm-tree.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="sc-body"><span class="bc-ic"><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 22v-5M7 17h10l-3-4h2l-4-5h1.5L12 3 8.5 8H10l-4 5h2z"/></svg></span><h2>Fallen Tree &amp; Ice Storm Appraisal</h2><p>Appraisal for Michigan fallen tree and ice storm claims, including roof framing, crane removal and debris limits.</p><span class="more">Learn more <svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="scard rv" href="/michigan-claim-appraisal/contents-personal-property-appraisal/"><span class="sc-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/living-room.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/living-room-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/living-room.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="797" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="sc-body"><span class="bc-ic"><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 8l-9-5-9 5v8l9 5 9-5z"/><path d="M3 8l9 5 9-5M12 13v8"/></svg></span><h2>Contents &amp; Personal Property</h2><p>Appraisal for Michigan personal property claims, challenging low pricing, heavy depreciation and missed items.</p><span class="more">Learn more <svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="scard rv" href="/michigan-claim-appraisal/insurance-estimate-second-opinion/"><span class="sc-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/calculator-papers.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/calculator-papers-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/calculator-papers.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="sc-body"><span class="bc-ic"><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><path d="M14 2v6h6M8 13h8M8 17h5"/></svg></span><h2>Estimate Second Opinion</h2><p>An independent line-by-line review of your insurer’s estimate so you can decide your next step with confidence.</p><span class="more">Learn more <svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="scard rv" href="/michigan-claim-appraisal/neutral-umpire-services/"><span class="sc-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/handshake.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/handshake-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/handshake.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, (max-width:1100px) 50vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="sc-body"><span class="bc-ic"><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3v18M7 21h10M5 7h14M5 7l-3 7a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 6 0zM19 7l-3 7a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 6 0z"/></svg></span><h2>Neutral Umpire Services</h2><p>Neutral umpire services for Michigan property insurance appraisals, by agreement of the appraisers or court appointment.</p><span class="more">Learn more <svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec sec-ice"><div class="wrap split split-top"><div class="rv"><p class="eyebrow">Not sure where to start?</p><h2>Most files begin with a second opinion</h2><p>Before anyone demands appraisal, it helps to know exactly where the carrier’s estimate falls short and what that gap is worth. A second opinion answers that quickly, and many disputes close right there with a documented supplement.</p><a class="btn btn-blue" href="/michigan-claim-appraisal/insurance-estimate-second-opinion/">About estimate second opinions <svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div><div class="rv"><div class="qa"><details><summary><span>Can I hire you for just one part of the process?</span><i class="qa-plus" aria-hidden="true"></i></summary><div class="qa-a"><p>Yes. Many clients start with an estimate second opinion and decide later whether to demand appraisal.</p></div></details><details><summary><span>Do you handle condo associations and businesses?</span><i class="qa-plus" aria-hidden="true"></i></summary><div class="qa-a"><p>Yes: offices, retail, industrial buildings, churches, apartment owners, condo associations and HOAs, as well as one- to four-family homes.</p></div></details><details><summary><span>Which Michigan losses do you see most?</span><i class="qa-plus" aria-hidden="true"></i></summary><div class="qa-a"><p>Hail and wind on roofs, basement water and sewer backups, ice dams and frozen pipes, fallen trees after ice storms, and fire and smoke.</p></div></details></div></div></div></section>
<section class="band"><div class="wrap band-in rv"><div><h2>Think the carrier’s number is too low?</h2><p>Send the estimate and a handful of photos. We’ll tell you what we see, free.</p></div><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn-maize" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn btn-glass" href="/request-claim-review/">Email the estimate</a></div></div></section>
